{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S6amfqa3FPXRH5FUFArsCU","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"base\": \"script-analysis-day-07-node-operation-graphs\",\n  \"lane\": \"script-analysis\",\n  \"name\": \"📜 Node by Node\",\n  \"ids\": {\n    \"single_solve\": \"script-analysis-day-07-node-operation-graphs\",\n    \"time_trial\": \"script-analysis-day-07-node-operation-graphs/time_trial\",\n    \"mastery\": \"script-analysis-day-07-node-operation-graphs/mastery\"\n  }\n}{\n  \"stage\": \"done\",\n  \"name\": \"\\ud83d\\udcdc Node by Node\",\n  \"lane\": \"script-analysis\",\n  \"worker\": null,\n  \"updated\": \"2026-10-07T21:06:20\",\n  \"launches\": 1,\n  \"attempt\": 1,\n  \"time_trial_result\": \"correct\",\n  \"mastery_result\": \"correct\"\n}# Day 7 — Node by Node (script-analysis, node operation graphs)\n\nConcept: one evidence.zip with 61 members (PowerShell samples, JScript/Batch/VBScript/Python/Bash/Node operation\ngraphs); each graph decodes to a plan (steps/adapter/campaign/indicator) and is sorted into a role.\n\nVARIANT AXIS: none in the bytes. TT attempt 26b7da83 failed because its download was the GM body `{\"error\":\"rate_limited\"}` (24 B saved as evidence.zip, sha != contract sha256), so every field came out None/default. The harvested variants 49b73141 + 7d6f8d53 were already answered 469/469 by the current solver (spot-checked against the raw bytes; their expected.json is solver-derived, not GM-verified). Parse rule: if every artifact is a small `{\"error\": ...}` JSON, exit non-zero (solve.py now does) instead of guessing roles. The bytes-less case was removed from cases/ (still kept under time_trial/attempts/26b7da83).\n\n## Proposed lib additions\n- `lib.common.gm_error_body(artdir) -> bytes|None`: detect a GM error JSON (`rate_limited`, ...) saved in place of an\n  artifact, so every solver fails loudly. Better still: the harness download step (hctf/hb_timed.py) should retry on\n  `{\"error\":\"rate_limited\"}` and never save it as the artifact. That would have saved this timed attempt.\n\n{\"seconds\": 13.0}{\"seconds\": 11.0}{\n  \"result\": \"correct\",\n  \"full_result\": \"correct\",\n  \"attempt_id\": \"2c52d50f-4072-4144-adbb-663aba144eb7\",\n  \"window\": 13.0,\n  \"elapsed\": 4.78,\n  \"in_window\": 3.93,\n  \"phases\": {\n    \"start\": 0.85,\n    \"download\": 0.5,\n    \"solve\": 1.5,\n    \"submit\": 1.92\n  },\n  \"routed\": \"homebase (window unknown)\",\n  \"novel_labels\": {},\n  \"deadline\": \"2026-10-07T13:06:28.215Z\"\n}{\n  \"result\": \"correct\",\n  \"full_result\": \"correct\",\n  \"attempt_id\": \"516aa6d1-d9ab-423b-9ea9-9d3b6a5aa394\",\n  \"window\": 11.0,\n  \"elapsed\": 13.47,\n  \"in_window\": 9.53,\n  \"phases\": {\n    \"start\": 3.94,\n    \"download\": 3.13,\n    \"solve\": 0.39,\n    \"submit\": 6.02\n  },\n  \"routed\": \"local\",\n  \"novel_labels\": {},\n  \"deadline\": \"2026-10-07T13:06:10.719Z\"\n}time_trial/attempts/26b7da83:\ntotal 224\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 testpwn testpwn   4096 Oct  7 21:03 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 testpwn testpwn   4096 Oct  7 21:03 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 testpwn testpwn 180025 Oct  7 21:03 contract.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 testpwn testpwn     24 Oct  7 21:03 evidence.zip\n-rw-r--r-- 1 testpwn testpwn  17718 Oct  7 21:03 last_timed.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 testpwn testpwn  15777 Oct  7 21:03 result.json\n\ntime_trial/attempts/5ab8013f:\ntotal 300\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 testpwn testpwn   4096 Oct  7 21:02 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 testpwn testpwn   4096 Oct  7 21:03 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 testpwn testpwn 179968 Oct  7 21:01 contract.json\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 testpwn testpwn  65512 Oct  7 21:01 evidence.zip\n-rw-r--r-- 1 testpwn testpwn  25006 Oct  7 21:02 last_timed.json\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 testpwn testpwn  23045 Oct  7 21:01 result.json\n# Triage: script-analysis-day-07-node-operation-graphs\n\n**Prompt:** Eight Node.js operation graphs that will never execute. Spot the indirect expansions and token fragmentation, then sort each graph into its role — benign, staging, dropp