{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012KGHuV5qygmDKHXExKuEk3","type":"tool_result","content":"# vocabulary (ELF_MACHINE above), NOT the Go GOARCH token (\"amd64\" REJECTED). Go config was the same HCFG blob.\nARCHITECTURE_USES_MACHINE_VOCAB = True\nARCHITECTURE_REJECTED = [\"amd64\"]\n# Day 6 \"Pool Party\" (binary, java-bytecode-loader), confirmed 2026-10-06: a Java .jar's `format` is plain \"jar\"\n# (the archive/container name, like elf/pe). The container_runtime compound \"jar_jvm\" was REJECTED, so the pe_cli\n# law does NOT extend to Java. The HCFG config sat base64'd in a constant-pool String (static final CONFIG).\nJAR_FORMAT = \"jar\"\nJAR_FORMAT_REJECTED = [\"jar_jvm\"]\nDOTNET_FORMAT_REJECTED = [\n    \"pe\", \"pe32\", \"PE\", \"PE32\", \"PE32+\", \"pei-i386\", \"coff\", \"winpe\", \"portable executable\",\n    \"dotnet\", \"DOTNET\", \".net\", \".NET\", \".Net\", \"net\", \"cil\", \"CIL\", \"msil\", \"MSIL\", \"il\", \"IL\",\nlib/knowledge.py:39:# Day 4 \"Go Fish\" (Go ELF, go1.25 buildinfo GOARCH=amd64): `architecture` CONFIRMED \"x86-64\" = the ELF machine\nlib/playbook.py:121:        lanes=(BINARY,), families=(\"architecture\",),\nlib/playbook.py:123:             \"arch token. Go ELF: use ELF e_machine `x86-64`, NEVER the Go buildinfo GOARCH `amd64`.\",\nlib/playbook.py:126:        examples=(\"Go ELF GOARCH=amd64 -> x86-64\",),\n      4 \"d06_analysis_hcfg_version\": \"1\"\n      2 \"d07_analysis_hcfg_version\": \"1\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2624e74-c74a-41db-9965-6b2cb921c121","uuid":"231bbb00-8b45-4143-89ba-54a3675d9dc1","timestamp":"2026-10-07T13:10:05.789Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# vocabulary (ELF_MACHINE above), NOT the Go GOARCH token (\"amd64\" REJECTED). Go config was the same HCFG blob.\nARCHITECTURE_USES_MACHINE_VOCAB = True\nARCHITECTURE_REJECTED = [\"amd64\"]\n# Day 6 \"Pool Party\" (binary, java-bytecode-loader), confirmed 2026-10-06: a Java .jar's `format` i